-- 02_tables.sql: column-only DDL for all 54 public base tables, from information_schema.columns.
-- APPLY ORDER: this file runs BEFORE 01_migrations.sql. 01's create-table/add-column statements are all
-- `if not exists` (verified), so they no-op against these tables; 01 then adds its own constraints.
-- No constraints, identity clauses or indexes here: see 01_migrations.sql and 07_constraints_indexes.sql.
